```


:::
:::




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
rnorm(1)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] 0.2774292
```


:::
:::



Volvamos a poner la semilla y saquemos un tercero:

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
